FIND  -FIND Control
> _ff  FIND FILE 
   _ff  [N]  pattern
   _ff  PATH  pattern
 ex.
   _ff 1 *.ts
   _ff ~/solidjs-dnd-resize  *.ts
> _ffo  FIND FILE  OPTION
   _fdo  [N]   key value
   _fdo  PATH  key value
          key = day min ymd_win ymd_ago size
 ex.
   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  day +10
   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  day -10
   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  day -1

   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  min -60
   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  min -120

   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  ymd_win "2026-08-23"
   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  ymd_win "2026-06-23"
   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  ymd_ago "2026-06-23"
   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  ymd_btw "2026-06-23:2026-08-23"

   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  size +2M
   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  size 2M
   _ffo times_test_dir/top/  size -2M

> _fd  FIND DRECTORY
   _fd  [N]  pattern
   _fd  PATH  pattern
 ex.
   _fd 1 src
   _fd ~/solidjs-dnd-resize  src

>  _fs       find current dir save
>  _fd [N]   find dir stack delete
>  _fp       find dir stack print
>  _fe       find dir stack edit
>  _fr       find dir stack reset
>  _fh       find help
>  _fa       find alias
